            "notes": "## \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Round 1 \u2013 \u201cSmash & Sustain\u201d Build Notes\n\n**\ud83d\udcb0 Budget:** $3,500  \n**\ud83c\udf00 Power:** `To Me, My Friends!` (Teamwide sustain aura)  \n**\ud83e\uddf0 Items:**\n- **Plasma Converter** *(W)* \u2013 Grants 10% lifesteal on all attacks  \n- **Weapon Grease** *(W)* \u2013 Boosts melee attack speed significantly  \n- **Heartbeat Sensor** *(S)* \u2013 Increases awareness and soft peels for allies\n\n### \ud83c\udfaf Purpose\nRound 1 establishes **early melee sustain** and zone presence. Lifesteal + attack speed lets you swing often and stay healthy while your aura helps your team survive long fights.\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n- Stay close to teammates to **maximize aura value**\n- Use fast swings to **keep lifesteal rolling**\n- Use Heartbeat Sensor to catch flankers or scout enemy paths\n- **Don't overextend**\u2014you're sturdy, not invincible\n\n### \ud83d\udcca Snapshot\n- **Health:** 700 HP  \n- **Armor:** 225  \n- **Shield:** 0  \n- **Attack Speed:** +5  \n- **Movement Speed:** +5  \n- **Weapon Lifesteal:** +10%",
